  "details": "VRC Video Player support was already requested, but even pure unity Video nodes are absent, which makes it really hard to make interactive panels with pre-made graphics.\n\nAll we can do is use \"play on awake\" and just toggle the gameobject to start playing, which creates awkward delays for the video to start playing and generally isn't very flexible.",
